tika Arithmetic in Omar++

dekhao 10 jog 5;                    tika addition
dekhao 10 biyog 3;                  tika subtraction
dekhao 6 gunon 7;                   tika multiplication
dekhao 20 vagfol 4;                 tika division
dekhao 7 vagfol 2;                  tika purno / purno stays purno
dekhao 7.0 vagfol 2;                tika dosomik division
dekhao 17 vagshesh 5;               tika remainder
dekhao 2 ghat 10;                   tika power
dekhao mulok(144);                  tika square root (always dosomik)

tika precedence and brackets
dekhao 2 jog 3 gunon 4;
dekhao (2 jog 3) gunon 4;
dekhao -5 jog 8;

tika text joining
dekhao "Omar" jog "++";
dekhao "Total: " jog 42;
shesh
